This archive distributes four binaries:

  * turf-mcp-server       — the Turf infrastructure MCP server, under the
    PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 (see LICENSE).
  * turf-engine           — the Turf engine, and
  * turf-builtin-provider — its built-in provider; both under the same license
    as turf-mcp-server.
  * turf                  — the reference Turf CLI. Open source under the
    Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0); source at
    https://github.com/turfbuild/turf.

The engine runs on restate-server (Restate, Business Source License 1.1),
which this archive does not contain: it is installed from Restate's own
distribution, and the engine runs it as a separate process.

The released turf CLI is built without CGO on every platform, so its
voice/audio capture is inactive in these binaries; text chat and all MCP
tooling are unaffected.

